; AdaptiveMultiStrategyEA - index mean-reversion sleeve, MAXIMUM-GROWTH setting (chapters 101 and 103). HIGH RISK.
; Same rules as AMS_Sleeves_Index.set. Differences: InpIxRevUnitVol=12.5 and the whole balance is used (InpIxEquityOffset=0).
; This is about the size where growth peaks; larger values earned LESS and lost more.
;   3,000,000 JPY, broker's own minute data, February 2020 - November 2026 (run 758): about +30% per year,
;   maximum drawdown 56%, worst month -33% (March 2020), worst 12 months -44%, 2022 as a whole -22%.
;   The last 3 years alone (run 749): +309% with a 39% drawdown - a good period, not the norm.
; "+300% in one year" did not happen in any 12-month window at any setting (chapter 101).
InpEntryMode=8
InpIxRevSymbols=US500,US100,US30
InpIxTrendSymbols=none
InpIxRuleR2=true
InpIxRuleD7=true
InpIxRuleIBS=true
InpIxRevUnitVol=12.5
InpIxTrendUnitVol=0.0
InpIxTrendCheckDays=7
InpIxMaxLev=10.0
InpIxBand=0.25
InpIxSLVolMul=4.0
InpIxVolModel=1
InpIxVixFile=AMS_vix.csv
InpIxVixLowMult=0.5
InpIxVixHighMult=1.5
InpIxRuleWeights=1,2,4
InpIxSoGuard=0.9
InpIxFlatMinutes=0
InpIxFlatEdgeBp=0.0
InpIxDelayMin=5
InpIxMaxSpreadPct=0.05
InpMaxMarginUsePct=90.0
InpIxJointRound=false
InpIxJointEps=0.25
InpIxWarmStart=true
InpIxRegimeDays=1500
InpIxRegimeThr=1.0
InpIxRegimeRef=US500
InpIxDryRun=false
InpIxEquityOffset=0
